<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak c.bank reserves slip to $3.55 bln - Oct 16.</title>
<headline>Slovak c.bank reserves slip to $3.55 bln - Oct 16.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Slovakia (NBS) on Friday said its hard currency reserves slipped to $3.551 billion as of October 16, from $3.570 billion on October 9.</p>
<p> HARD CURRENCY RESERVES     Oct 16    Oct 9     Oct '95</p>
<p>  NBS reserves ($bln)	 3.551     3.570     2.873</p>
<p>  Commercial banks	    1.227     1.254     1.556</p>
<p>  Entire banking sector     4.778     4.824     4.429</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-563-3687</p>
</text>
